troke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg>B区6床 · 复评</strong>补液已结束；关注复评，下一班记录复评结果。</div><div><strong><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>抢救区2床 · 家属到达</strong>已联系上，预计稍后到达；持续关注到达情况。</div></section><h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bed-double\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 20v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8\"></path><path d=\"M4 10V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 4v6\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path></svg>六床最新状态｜按区域定位</h2><table><thead><tr><th style='width:17%'>区域 / 床位</th><th style='width:17%'>留观背景</th><th style='width:29%'>最新测量与状态</th><th>检查进展 / 沟通状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>抢救区 · 1床</td><td>呼吸困难</td><td><span class='metric'>SpO₂ 93% → 复测96%</span><br>持续监测中</td><td class='pending'>胸部影像结果仍待回报</td></tr><tr><td>抢救区 · 2床</td><td>胸痛</td><td>生命体征平稳</td><td>第二次心电图已完成，医生正在查看<br><span class='sub'>家属已联系上，预计稍后到达</span></td></tr><tr><td>留观A区 · 3床</td><td>腹痛</td><td><span class='metric'>疼痛评分 7分 → 4分</span><br>最新仍为4分</td><td class='done'>检验结果已回报，责任医生正在评估</td></tr><tr><td>留观A区 · 4床</td><td>跌倒后留观</td><td>意识清楚；起身不稳</td><td>影像检查已完成，<span class='pending'>报告尚未返回</span></td></tr><tr><td>留观B区 · 5床</td><td>发热</td><td><span class='metric'>38.2℃ → 复测37.6℃</span></td><td>采样已送检，<span class='pending'>结果仍未回报</span></td></tr><tr><td>留观B区 · 6床</td><td>脱水评估中</td><td>补液已结束；持续关注复评</td><td>下一班记录复评结果<br><span class='sub'>家属已到达，可以协助沟通</span></td></tr></tbody></table><footer><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>处置原则｜具体处置以责任医生的判断和医嘱为准。</footer></main>"
      }
